## Cloudflare Worker

- Worker: `binance-future-hunter`
- D1/KV di `wrangler.toml` bisa nunjuk resource lama (rebrand continuity) — tanya user sebelum `d1 create` / ganti `database_id`
- Urutan: `typecheck`+`test` hijau → `d1 migrations apply … --remote` → `wrangler deploy`
- Verify: `GET /` → `"name":"binance-future-hunter"`; tool via `POST /mcp`

## Bukan Docker

- VPS Oracle: systemd units (`whale-binance-proxy`, `whale-stream-gateway`) + Caddy
- `stream-gateway/install.sh` idempotent; Node 22+ (`node:sqlite`)
- WS process terpisah dari REST relay — bug WS tidak boleh matikan relay

## proxy-standalone

- Vercel relay REST; secrets Worker: `PROXY_URL`, `PROXY_SECRET`
- Jangan taruh logic pipeline di sini

## Monitoring gap (Stage 4, belum ada)

- Uptime eksternal: worker `/` + VPS `/health`
- CF notification rule error-rate/CPU — observability on, alert rule belum

